Name (for example, Excel.Sheet or PowerPoint.Slide) that's used by the Windows registry to uniquely identify an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147051">ProgID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890969">ProgID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10362_103575_1495590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To change the size of an element on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="103575">resize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495590">өлчөмдү өзгөртүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10367_129177_1494084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The display of information from a given perspective or location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="129177">view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494084">көрүнүшү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10380_156547_2258769"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document describing a company's position on privacy, detailing what information it collects, with whom the data is shared, and how users can control the use of their personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="156547">privacy statement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2258769">купуялык билдирүүсү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10396_158410_463532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to, being, or characteristic of something that is not dependent on timing. Each application or command runs in the specified order, but the specified item does not wait for any previously started processes to finish before an application or command runs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="158410">asynchronous</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463532">асинхрондук</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10396_2479304_463532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to, being, or characteristic of something that is not dependent on timing. Each application or command runs in the specified order, but the specified item does not wait for any previously started processes to finish before an application or command runs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2479304">async</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463532">асинхрондук</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="104_234833_1493599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organizational feature of Windows that displays a panel on the side of the desktop with shortcuts to mini-applications, also known as gadgets. The examples of such gadgets are local weather, a photo slideshow, a dictionary, news headlines, and a Windows Media Player control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234833">Windows Sidebar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1493599">Windows каптал-панели</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10402_146400_1890964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text or some other element used in an application as an indicator that the user should enter in his or her own text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146400">placeholder text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890964">орун кармагыч тексти</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10414_270278_463991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A line that separates the numerator and denominator of a fraction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="270278">fraction bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463991">бөлчөк сызыгы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10421_210482_1891020"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A small space on the To-Do Bar where the user can input tasks directly. The default label reads "Type a new task".</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210482">task input panel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891020">тапшырма киргизүү чети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_318356_462959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318356">left angle bracket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462959">кичине белгиси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_318356_464224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318356">left angle bracket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464224">сол кашаа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_318750_462959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318750">LESS-THAN SIGN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462959">кичине белгиси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_318750_464224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318750">LESS-THAN SIGN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464224">сол кашаа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_74325_462959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="74325">less than sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462959">кичине белгиси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10422_74325_464224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &lt; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="74325">less than sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464224">сол кашаа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10423_232516_1494085"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data from a table, form, query, view, or stored procedure, displayed in a row-and-column format.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232516">datasheet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494085">жадыбал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10431_232847_1891062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that is designed for reading documents on a computer screen. The document is resized to fit the screen and most toolbars are removed, but commands are available for navigating, commenting, and looking up words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232847">reading layout view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891062">окуу калыптоо көрүнүшү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10436_415517_2441616"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Editor feature that gives users feedback on how easy it is for a reader to understand a written text based on information such as average sentence length and average word length.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415517">Readability Statistics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441616">окууга эптүүлүк статистикасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10437_168488_1950747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An optional Live Meeting tool that allows users to create Live Meeting slides and add a presenter photo as part of a Microsoft PowerPoint file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168488">PowerPoint add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1950747">PowerPoint кыналмасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10443_294444_1944358"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of chart that compares the aggregate values of a number of data series.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294444">radar chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944358">желекчелер түрүндөгү диаграмма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10444_139402_463388"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A design template that also contains text suggestions on each slide. You replace the text suggestions with the text that you want. A content template contains a slide master and an optional title master.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139402">content template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463388">мазмун шаблону</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10444_139402_463389"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A design template that also contains text suggestions on each slide. You replace the text suggestions with the text that you want. A content template contains a slide master and an optional title master.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139402">content template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463389">мазмун үлгүсү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1045_137287_1493650"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text displayed by Web browsers during image downloads for users who have graphics turned off, and for users who rely on screen-reading software to convert graphics on the screen to spoken words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137287">alternative text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1493650">альтернативалык текст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1045_137287_1496097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text displayed by Web browsers during image downloads for users who have graphics turned off, and for users who rely on screen-reading software to convert graphics on the screen to spoken words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137287">alternative text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496097">ALT текст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1045_765697_1493650"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text displayed by Web browsers during image downloads for users who have graphics turned off, and for users who rely on screen-reading software to convert graphics on the screen to spoken words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="765697">ALT text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1493650">альтернативалык текст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1045_765697_1496097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text displayed by Web browsers during image downloads for users who have graphics turned off, and for users who rely on screen-reading software to convert graphics on the screen to spoken words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="765697">ALT text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496097">ALT текст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10450_102839_1495591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To put new data in the place of other data, usually after conducting a search for the data to be replaced. Text-based applications such as word processors typically include Find and Replace commands.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="102839">replace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495591">орун алмаштыруу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10451_16349_1666611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Relating to frequencies within the range of perception by the human ear - from about 15 to 20,000 hertz (cycles per second).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="16349">audio</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1666611">үн</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10459_116136_2182244"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of markup in markup languages. A start tag is the starting element of a tag pair which contains metainformation about some part of the text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116136">start tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2182244">тэг башы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1048_188097_1493651"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Anything owned or controlled by a business, tangible or intangible, that has monetary value and was acquired at a measurable cost.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="188097">asset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1493651">активдер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10482_236960_1494086"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that opens Sync Center.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236960">Open Sync Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494086">Ачылуучу синхрондоштуруу борбору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNou