 unit to a client computer or device for installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233734">deployment package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891070">жаюу таңгагы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11268_2461481_1816981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Control Panel feature that is used to set restrictions on what traffic is allowed to enter your network from the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2461481">Windows Defender Firewall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1816981">Windows фаэрволу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11268_2461481_2466086"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Control Panel feature that is used to set restrictions on what traffic is allowed to enter your network from the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2461481">Windows Defender Firewall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466086">Windows коргоочусунун фаэрволу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><term