gular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11947_65138_1494153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In an environment capable of displaying multiple on-screen windows, any window other than the one currently being used for work. An inactive window can be partially or entirely hidden behind another window, and it remains inactive until the user selects it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="65138">inactive window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494153">актив эмес терезе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11968_1089155_464223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &amp; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1089155">&amp;</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464223">&amp; символу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11968_318355_464223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &amp; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318355">ampersand</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464223">&amp; символу</term><termNote type="geograp