mon database, directory database, or tree and that is administered as a unit with common rules and procedures, which can include security policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47604">domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462749">домен</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16119_329894_464336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request for payment for products and/or services sold.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329894">bill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464336">эсеп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16120_89167_1890868"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The packaged Windows Media file that is created with Windows Media Rights Manager SDK.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="89167">output file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890868">чыгаруу файлы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1613_343638_464376"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of producing copies of documents, publications, or images in high volume.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="343638">commercial printing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464376">өнөр жайлык басып чыгаруу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16130_334521_464347"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formal or legally binding agreement between two or more parties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="334521">contract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464347">келишим</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16144_121017_1495674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Formatting that controls the appearance of a text. Examples include text alignment, intercharacter spacing, text justification, and text and background colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="121017">text formatting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495674">тексти форматтоо</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16150_545626_1950751"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic element from the SmartArt feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545626">SmartArt graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1950751">SmartArt графикасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16158_143130_1494311"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Paragraph formatting in which the second and subsequent lines of a paragraph are indented more than the first line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143130">hanging indent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494311">абзацты калтыруу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16161_234782_2017601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of preset power-management options. For example, you can set elapsed times for putting your computer on standby and for turning off your monitor and hard disk. You save these settings as a named power scheme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234782">power plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2017601">энергияны башкаруу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16161_234782_2017602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of preset power-management options. For example, you can set elapsed times for putting your computer on standby and for turning off your monitor and hard disk. You save these settings as a named power scheme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234782">power plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2017602">энергияны башкаруу схемасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16161_94159_2017601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of preset power-management options. For example, you can set elapsed times for putting your computer on standby and for turning off your monitor and hard disk. You save these settings as a named power scheme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="94159">power scheme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2017601">энергияны башкаруу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16161_94159_2017602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of preset power-management options. For example, you can set elapsed times for putting your computer on standby and for turning off your monitor and hard disk. You save these settings as a named power scheme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="94159">power scheme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2017602">энергияны башкаруу схемасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16175_1508829_1891420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area at the left side in some dialog boxes, such as Save As, Open, and Insert Picture that contains shortcuts to various folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508829">Places Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891420">Жайлар Тилкеси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16175_477172_1891420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area at the left side in some dialog boxes, such as Save As, Open, and Insert Picture that contains shortcuts to various folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="477172">My Places bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891420">Жайлар Тилкеси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16176_143109_1890936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A margin setting that adds extra space to the side or top margin of a document you plan to bind. A gutter margin ensures that text isn't obscured by the binding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143109">gutter margin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890936">актай талаа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16190_184195_1891002"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Content has been hashed and verified as valid against the signature. The certificate used to verify the signature is “valid” in the sense that it has a relationship to a trusted certificate authority (and isn’t expired, etc.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184195">Signed - verified</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891002">Кол коюлган - ырасталган</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16213_2167436_2193425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hard plastic disc on a mouse that is perpendicular to the mouse surface. It is normally located between the left and right mouse buttons and is used for scrolling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2167436">mouse wheel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2193425">чычкандын дөңгөлөгү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16213_534934_2193425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hard plastic disc on a mouse that is perpendicular to the mouse surface. It is normally located between the left and right mouse buttons and is used for scrolling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="534934">scroll wheel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2193425">чычкандын дөңгөлөгү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1622_234771_463775"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to Microsoft software which is published by Microsoft, properly licensed, and fully supported by Microsoft or a trusted partner.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234771">genuine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463775">анык</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16223_237296_1491848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to select from a gallery of pre-defined formatting styles and apply them quickly to tables, text, charts, drawing objects and SmartArt graphics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237296">Quick Styles</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1491848">Ыкчам стилдер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16225_232420_1495675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secure email feature that lets you add sensitivity labels, such as Internal Use Only, to the message header. Security labels in your organization are controlled by security policies set up by your email administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232420">security label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495675">коопсуздук белгиси</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16250_174770_1890995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rectangle with sizing handles that surrounds a selected object or objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="174770">selection rectangle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890995">тандоо тик бурчтугу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16250_645093_1890995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rectangle with sizing handles that surrounds a selected object or objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645093">selection box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1890995">тандоо тик бурчтугу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16263_10901_462446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To position objects or text relative to some point, such as the page margin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="10901">align</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462446">тегиздөө</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16276_263115_1944416"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a file format that allows for VBA code. Examples of file extensions for macro-enabled formats are .docm, .pptm, .xlsm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="263115">macro-enabled</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944416">макростор иштей турган</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16290_237379_463841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Office Server that provides a workflow for document review.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237379">Document Review</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463841">Документти карап чыгуу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="163_311257_1493603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user preferences for the formatting of dates, currencies, numbers, and so on. The user locale is a per-user setting, and does not require the user to restart or to log on or log off the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="311257">user locale</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1493603">колдонуучунун локалы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16315_140027_1494312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A dialog box that displays one complete record at a time. You can use data forms to add, change, locate, and delete records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140027">data form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494312">берилмелер формасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16317_209984_1494313"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Media Player, a database that contains information about digital media files on a computer, a network drive, or the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="209984">library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494313">жыйнак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16319_119343_1793323"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One or more rows of cells commonly used to display numbers and other items for quick reference and analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="119343">table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1793323">жадыбал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16322_143641_1495677"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cell in which each input value from a data table is substituted. Any cell on a worksheet can be the input cell. Although the input cell does not need to be part of the data table, the formulas in data tables must refer to the input cell.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143641">input cell</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495677">кирүү уячасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16327_163539_1494314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The adjustment of the spacing between two characters to create the appearance of even spacing, fit text to a given space, and adjust line breaks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="163539">kerning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494314">тамгалар аралыгын өзгөртүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1633_262439_1495418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A proposed standard digital rights management (DRM) markup language which enables users to specify rights and conditions associated with resources, such as digital content or Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262439">XrML</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495418">укуктарды белгилөө тили</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1633_262439_463887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A proposed standard digital rights management (DRM) markup language which enables users to specify rights and conditions associated with resources, such as digital content or Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262439">XrML</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463887">XrML</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1633_262440_1495418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A proposed standard digital rights management (DRM) markup language which enables users to specify rights and conditions associated with resources, such as digital content or Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262440">extensible rights markup language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495418">укуктарды белгилөө тили</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1633_262440_463887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A proposed standard digital rights management (DRM) markup language which enables users to specify rights and conditions associated with resources, such as digital content or Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262440">extensible rights markup language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463887">XrML</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16337_117385_1495678"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One character (or more) printed slightly below the baseline of surrounding text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="117385">subscript</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495678">астынкы индекс</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16338_210449_1891011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The core component of the Excel Server that includes the full Excel calculation functionality. It loads and saves Excel workbooks, queries and refreshes external data, calculates workbooks, and provides the calculated results to the caller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210449">Excel Calculation Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891011">Excel Эсептөө Сервери</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16344_18758_462491"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the context of processes or tasks that are part of an operating system or program, operating without interaction with the user while the user is working on another task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="18758">background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462491">фондук</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16348_318717_464234"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To advance audio or video playback at a speed that is faster than normal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318717">fast forward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464234">алдыга түрүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16358_210492_463644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of attack that tries to trick users into revealing personal information, such as credit card numbers, bank accounts, or passwords, often using links to fake websites included in emails and chat messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210492">phishing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463644">фишинг</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338551_1494315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338551">privilege attribute certificate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494315">ыйгарым укугу бар атрибуттуу сертификат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338551_1495679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338551">privilege attribute certificate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495679">PAC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338565_1494315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338565">PAC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1494315">ыйгарым укугу бар атрибуттуу сертификат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338565_1495679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338565">PAC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495679">PAC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1639_148511_1495419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A workbook that is configured to allow multiple users on a network to view and make changes at the same time. Each user who saves the workbook sees the changes that are made by other users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148511">shared workbook</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495419">чогуу колдонмо иш китеби</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16414_583814_2576100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of an integrated development environment (IDE) that provides logical code elements that the user can select from a drop-down menu while coding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="583814">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576100">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16438_584264_1891121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares values across categories. The categories are organized horizontally, and values vertically, to emphasize variation over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584264">clustered column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891121">тутамдалган мамыча диаграммасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16439_584277_1891122"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares the percentage that each value contributes to a total across categories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584277">100% stacked column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891122">100% үйүлгөн мамыча диаграммасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16440_584278_1891123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares data points along two axes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584278">3-D column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891123">3-D Мамычалуу диаграмма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16441_584279_1891124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variation on a column chart that uses cylinder shapes instead of rectangular columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584279">cylinder chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891124">жумуру диаграмма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16442_584280_1891125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variation on a column chart that uses cone shapes instead of rectangular columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584280">cone chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891125">жумуру диаграммасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16443_584281_1891126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variation on a column chart that uses pyramid shapes instead of rectangular columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584281">pyramid chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891126">пирамида диаграммасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16444_584282_1891127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A stacked column chart that creates the effect of floating columns by making the first data series invisible. The result is a chart that depicts minimum and maximum values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584282">floating column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891127">калкыма мамыча диаграммасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16445_584286_1891128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar chart subtype that compares the percentage that each value contributes to a total across categories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584286">100% stacked bar chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGr