s Photo Viewer which consists of a top level window displaying one photograph at a time, with navigation controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768421">Photo Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495810">Фото көрсөткүч</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21278_768422_2253992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode of Windows Photo Viewer which displays full-screen slide shows for photos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768422">Slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2253992">Слайдшоу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21290_768424_1495812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recordable media (such as CD-RW) to which you can only write once without reformatting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768424">single session-only disc</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495812">жалгыз сеанска гана диск</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21291_768440_1495813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recordable media to which you can write several times without reformatting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768440">multi session-capable disc</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495813">көп сессиялуу диск</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21299_768624_1495814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that is added to the Microsoft Office Compatibility Pack to open Word, Excel, and PowerPoint binary format files and securely convert them to the Office 2007 file formats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768624">Microsoft Office Isolated Conversion Environment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495814">MOICE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21299_768625_1495814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that is added to the Microsoft Office Compatibility Pack to open Word, Excel, and PowerPoint binary format files and securely convert them to the Office 2007 file formats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768625">MOICE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495814">MOICE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21300_1054681_1495815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that makes Outlook auto-complete lists available through the default Exchange mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054681">Suggested Contacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495815">Сунушталган байланыштар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21301_769458_2258367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A common credential store and interface that is used to save and manage user credentials, such as user names and passwords, so you can easily log on to Web sites and connect to other resources, such as computers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="769458">Credential Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2258367">Аныктоочу башкаруучусу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21302_769460_1495817"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of credentials that users can create, store and manage in Credential Manager.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="769460">vault</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495817">сактагыч</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21303_769462_1495818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of vault that contains Web passwords and secure notes that you can place on a USB flash drive and use on another computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="769462">personal vault</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495818">жеке сактагыч</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2132_125577_1493700"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">When referring to a device, to remove the corresponding device drivers from the hard disk and physically remove the device from the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="125577">uninstall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></ter