 feature that enables users to share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers with other people on a home network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777441">Windows HomeGroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495828">Үй тобу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21417_779020_1495828"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that enables users to share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers with other people on a home network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="779020">HomeGroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495828">Үй тобу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21442_777482_1944379"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An abstract grouping of similar transition effects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777482">transition style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944379">өтүү стили</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</t