 example, low values in a range appear as blue (cold) and high values as red (hot).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2593079">heatmap</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340824">ысык картасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2599_211415_463658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Intel microprocessor that uses explicitly parallel instruction set computing and 64-bit memory addressing. "Itanium-based" refers to systems or platforms that are based on the Itanium processor. "Itanium2-based" refers to systems or platforms that are based on the Itanium2 processor. "Itanium architecture-based" refers to systems or platforms that are based on the Itanium and Itanium2 processors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211415">Itanium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463658">Itanium</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_1253847_1661989"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253847">social network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1661989">коомдук желе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_1253847_2798212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253847">social network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2798212">коомдук тармак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_2696313_1661989"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696313">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1661989">коомдук желе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_2696313_2798212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696313">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2798212">коомдук тармак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26004_1256406_1496228"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short summary of the contents of a document that gives the reader a quick overview of its topic and purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256406">abstract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496228">аннотация</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26050_1262328_2803632"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To merge information from multiple places into one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262328">consolidate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2803632">бириктирүү</term><termNote typ