at denotes the presence of a comment and opens the comment when clicked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623958">comment hint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891458">жорум кулак кагышы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31789_1623959_1891459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pane beside the document that displays all comments made in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623959">Comments pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891459">Жорумдар чети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31790_1623960_1891460"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A crawl that operates on a continuous basis to scan and index new and modified content from a source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623960">continuous crawl</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891460">токтоосуз жөргөлөө</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31793_1623963_1891461"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An instance of Excel that has minimal UI and that enables a user to insert or edit chart data within the context of a non-Excel Office document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623963">Data Grid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891461">Айтымдар Чакмагы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31794_1623978_1891462"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The categories of assignments for a given class, along with a percentage value that indicates how much each category weighs into the overall grade. Other factors, such as class participation, may also be considered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623978">evaluation criteria</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891462">баалоо критерийи</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31795_1623979_1891463"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of refining a search for information by filtering on individual properties or facets of the items being searched.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623979">faceted navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891463">четтелген жол өтүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31796_1623980_1891464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Comments about a completed assignment that an educator makes during review and grading and that are available to the student once the grade is posted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623980">feedback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891464">кайтарым жооп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31799_1624313_1891465"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A JavaScript API that provides simple and consistent programmatic access to Office documents and applications across Office client environments through common as well as application-specific data types, objects, functions and events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1624313">JavaScript API for Office</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1891465">Office үчүн JavaScript API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNot