OfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321432">ИТ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2324656"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324656">Туташуу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39882_2320437_2324657"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for purchasing cellular data that is packaged with cellular enabled Dell devices that include a Microsoft SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320437">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324657">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2324664"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324664">Эң жогору бааланган ТВ шоу программалары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39890_2321510_2324658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of items emphasized to the customer through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321510">Featured collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324658">Белгилүү жыйнактар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39891_2321511_2324661"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make your search results more relevant by excluding unwanted and extraneous items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321511">refine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324661">жакшыртуу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39892_2321518_2324660"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to temporarily connect to available free Wi-Fi hotspots in order to find and buy Wi-Fi services from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321518">paid Wi-Fi services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324660">төлөнгөн Wi-Fi кызматтары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39932_2323787_2344350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323787">sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2344350">sway түзүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39935_2324831_2325776"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To install an operating system image on a device, reformatting all partitions as part of the process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324831">flash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></