o use ink to draw using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles pencil graphite.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432493">pencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436882">карандаш</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42888_2432494_2436881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to use ink to draw using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles traditional pen ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432494">pen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436881">калем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42889_2432495_2436885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that is activated when clicked once, and when clicked a second time, opens a menu that allows the user to modify the mode of the selected tool.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432495">secondary action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436885">экинчи аракет топчусу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42890_2432497_2436886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that is opened via a secondary action button and that gives users one or more options for changing the mode of the selected tool.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432497">secondary action menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436886">экинчи аракет менюсу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42891_2432499_2436884"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An in-ribbon container that holds a collection of buttons and where the user can add additional buttons, reorganize buttons, and scroll through them when they are not all visible within the container.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432499">scrollable button group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436884">түрүлмө топчу тобу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42895_2433212_2436883"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The contextual ribbon tab that appears when users select a picture.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2433212">Picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436883">Сүрөт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42900_2433217_2435796"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Literally, "without stroke"; describes any typeface in which the characters have no serifs (the short lines or ornaments at the upper and lower ends of the strokes.) A sans serif typeface usually possesses a more straightforward, geometric appearance than a typeface with serifs and typically lacks the contrast between thick and thin strokes found in serif faces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2433217">sans serif</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435796">белгиси жок</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4293_37521_462649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The state of an expression or a variable (for example, when a result can be either true or false, or equal or not equal).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37521">condition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="462649">шарт</term><termNote