ally incorrect pronoun use and offers suggestions to correct the error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438464">Incorrect Pronoun Case</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2442316">Ат атооч туура эмес жөндөлдү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43044_2438783_2440483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The drawing app you can use to create simple or elaborate drawings. These drawings can be either black-and-white or color. You can also use Paint to work with pictures, such as .jpg, .gif, or .bmp files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438783">Microsoft Paint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440483">Microsoft Paint</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43044_2438783_2440484"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The drawing app you can use to create simple or elaborate drawings. These drawings can be either black-and-white or color. You can also use Paint to work with pictures, such as .jpg, .gif, or .bmp files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438783">Microsoft Paint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet>