d format that Microsoft is offering ​for headphones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466503">Windows Sonic for Headphones</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469759">Кулакчындар үчүн Windows Sonic</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43717_2466997_2470303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 designed for small and medium businesses that includes the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus additional management policies that can be helpful to business customers. This edition is only available through subscription as part of a larger package of services, and is not available as a standalone download.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466997">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470303">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43734_2467150_2469755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Mixed Reality and Windows Holographic, an app type or app state in which the app renders as a flat window, not an immersive experience.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467150">2D view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469755">2D көрүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43740_2467488_2598446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The online learning platform that combines the content from Lynda.com with LinkedIn’s professional network to provide personalized course recommendations and a more intuitive experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467488">LinkedIn Learning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2598446">Learning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43740_2598335_2598446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The online learning platform that combines the content from Lynda.com with LinkedIn’s professional network to provide personalized course recommendations and a more intuitive experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2598335">Learning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2598446">Learning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468662_2473014"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468662">Ink Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473014">кол менен жазылган нерселерди математикалык туюнтмаларга айландыруу жардамчысы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468662_2473015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468662">Ink Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473015">математикалык туюнтмаларга айландыруу жардамчысы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468663_2473014"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468663">Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473014">кол менен жазылган нерселерди математикалык туюнтмаларга айландыруу жардамчысы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468663_2473015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468663">Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473015">математикалык туюнтмаларга айландыруу жардамчысы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43761_2469253_2473016"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word print layout that allows horizontal movement between pages in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469253">Page-Stack navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473016">барактоо</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43762_2469812_2472908"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Sound that is spatialized or is precisely located around a listener in 3D space. Developers can use spatial sound in an application to convincingly place sounds in a 3D space all around the user. Sounds will then seem as if they are coming from real physical objects even though the user may only be using regular stereo headphones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469812">spatial sound</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472908">мейкиндиктүү үн</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470183_2472909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470183">variable refresh rate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472909">өзгөрмөлүү жаңылануу жыштыгы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470183_2472910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470183">variable refresh rate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472910">VRR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470196_2472909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470196">VRR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472909">өзгөрмөлүү жаңылануу жыштыгы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470196_2472910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470196">VRR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472910">VRR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43799_2470927_2472112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The lightweight markup language with plain text formatting syntax designed to be converted to HTML and other formats and that is used to format readme files, write messages in online discussion forums, and create rich text using a plain text editor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470927">Markdown</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472112">Markdown</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43800_2470929_2472113"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word add-in that converts Markdown documents to Word format for editing and then converts the Word document back to Markdown format, using the Paragraph, Table, List, and Range objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470929">Markdown editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472113">Markdown editor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43827_2472567_2499188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A movie created in the Photos app, featuring a set of related pictures and videos combined with a soundtrack, transitions and other effects. This term can also be used to refer to the set of photos and videos included in the story. ​A story may be created automatically by the app, or manually by the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472567">story</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499188">окуя</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4384_319144_1495483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The “ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319144">opening quotation mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1495483">ачуу тырмакчасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4384_319144_464260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The “ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319144">opening quotation mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464260">тырмакча</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">