 international phone calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2581350">Office 365 Communications Credits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2850879">алдын ала төлөнгөн намыян</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45139_2843752_2850877"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that provides a way to pay for calls and helps ensure that the users are able to make audio conferences or international phone calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843752">prepaid wallet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2850877">Байланышуулар насыялары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45139_2843752_2850878"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that provides a way to pay for calls and helps ensure that the users are able to make audio conferences or international phone calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843752">prepaid wallet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2850878">Office 365 Байланышуулар насыялары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type