along with a related text style and music. It evokes a simple, classic, and elegant look and feel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549940">Classic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553939">Классикалык</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45146_2549941_2553934"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip to give it a slightly whitened, lightened, or bleached effect.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549941">Blanch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553934">Агартуу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45147_2549942_2553954"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The black and white filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549942">Portrait</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553954">Портрет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45148_2549943_2553948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The black and white filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip. This filter has deeper blacks and whiter whites than other filters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549943">Inky</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553948">Ак-кара</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45149_2549945_2553957"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it an effect of muted late evening light.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549945">Twilight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553957">Күүгүм</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45150_2549970_2553944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the red and orange tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549970">Energy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553944">Энергия</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45151_2549985_2553947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the blue tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549985">Iceberg</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553947">Айсберг</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45152_2550010_2553950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the green tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550010">Kelly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553950">Жашыл түстөр</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45153_2550035_2553936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550035">Brassy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553936">Жандуу түстөр</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45154_2550036_2553941"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a slightly rough and worn out quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550036">Denim</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553941">Деним</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45155_2550037_2553940"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which sharpens the image and keeps colors intact.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550037">Clean</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553940">Таза</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45156_2550038_2553937"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a muted, blue-green effect. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music. It evokes a subdued, cool, relaxed look and feel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550038">Chilled</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553937">Муздак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45157_2550041_2553943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a feeling of energy, and the purple light you might see before an electrical storm. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550041">Electric</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553943">Электрикалык</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45158_2550043_2553956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a golden brownish hue like sand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550043">Sandy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553956">Кумдуу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45159_2550044_2553949"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a cheerful, playful, sunny feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550044">Joy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553949">Шайыр</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45160_2550045_2553938"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a yellow tone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550045">Citrus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553938">Цитрус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45161_2550046_2553952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has a coarse texture and hard edges like metal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550046">Metallic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553952">Метталликалык</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45162_2550047_2553932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has the faded quality of photos taken in the mid-1960s.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550047">1966</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553932">1966</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45163_2550050_2553951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has a warm, sentimental feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550050">Loved</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gramma