 text overlay style in Story Remix. This style is big, bold and uses very large type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550383">Boom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553935">Күүлдөк</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45190_2550385_2553946"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix. This style is big, bold, and uses a colored block with transparent lettering that resembles a stencil or poster graphic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550385">Graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553946">Графика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45191_2550387_2553955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text overlay style in Story Remix, with a semi-opaque white background, and subtle typography.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550387">Quiet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553955">Тынч</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45192_2550388_2553942"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix, with white outlined, transparent lettering that looks modern, linear, and authentic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550388">Downtown</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553942">Айылдык</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45210_2551936_2555484"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows customers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551936">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555484">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45210_2551936_2666006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows customers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></d