 Dynamic Lock, and other convenience and security features related to accounts and login.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594916">account protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597584">каттоо жазуунун коргоосу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46047_2594920_2597585"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area in Windows Defender Security Center, within Ransomware protection, where customers can set up or initiate file restores with cloud providers, to help recover from a ransomware attack (which often encrypts files).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594920">Ransomware data recovery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597585">Опузалап алуучу программадан маалыматтарды калыбына келтирүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46048_2594927_2597586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar), where customers can find and use features to help prevent or recover from ransomware attacks.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594927">Ransomware protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597586">Опузалап алуучу программадан коргоо</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46049_2594936_2597587"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar) where customers can see the history of the threats found on their devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594936">Threat history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597587">Коркунч тарыхы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46050_2594944_2597588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Defender Security Center app on Windows 10, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar) where customers can see information about ​the definitions being used to recognize the latest threats on their device, and check for updates to those definitions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594944">Virus &amp; threat protection updates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597588">Вирус жана коркунчту коргоо жаңыртуулары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</