 according to the organization’s customized rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2747247">call queue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2750676">чакыруу кезмети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48575_2747295_2750680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables users to use a pinch gesture to zoom in and out of the Photos view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2747295">Super Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2750680">Супер Арымдоо</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4859_295625_464024"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A letter that serves to introduce accompanying documents to the recipient. Often refers to a letter sent with a resume when applying for a job.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="295625">cover letter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464024">коштоочу кат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48609_2754104_2760280"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Phone System add-on feature that allows organizations to create a customized call with the ability to create a customized greeting, multiple call queues, as well the ability to automatically put calls on hold, search for the next available call agent, and play music while callers are in their queues.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754104">Cloud call queue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760280">Булут чакыруу кезмети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48626_2751831_2753702"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A distributed network that has no dedicated servers and whose connection is established between different devices where each device can be a client or a server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2751831">peer-to-peer network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753702">тең-теңине тармак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48650_2753556_2760283"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A means of marketing that uses one or more digital signage device and that targets a specific audience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753556">digital signage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760283">санарип көрнөк</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48675_2753774_2760285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A means of spreading multiple incoming calls to a single telephone number, to multiple lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753774">line hunting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760285">линияны акмалоо</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48677_2753779_2760291"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The second argument in a VLOOKUP or HLOOKUP function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753779">table_array</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760291">жамаат мүчөсү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48678_2753781_2760286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A state of having different changes made to the same document in multiple locations that can prevent the document from being saved until they are reconciled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753781">page conflict</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760286">бет кагылышуусу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48679_2753782_2760281"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A total amount of time spent at work emailing, in meetings, and on chats or calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753782">collaboration time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760281">кызматташуу убагы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48682_2753813_2760288"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies a row in an Excel sheet in order, starting at 1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753813">row index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760288">сап көрсөткүчү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48683_2753814_2760282"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A letter that identifies a column in an Excel sheet in order, starting at A.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753814">column index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760282">мамыча көрсөткүчү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48689_2753982_2760290"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who has access to their team's OneNote and libraries and who share an individual notebook with their staff leader.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753982">staff member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2760290">жадыбал_массиви</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48692_2754091_2758604"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A physical letter sent to a person requesting a number to verify that he/she resides in the same area where he/she would like to purchase a number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754091">verification letter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758604">ырастоо каты</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48693_2754106_2762672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A disabled user object that can be used to represent and assign resources within Azure, Office 365, and Skype.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754106">resource account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762672">такоолдун эсеп жазуусу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48694_2754396_2758601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Kaizala chat feature that allows users to send confidential information in a one-to-one chat more securely by not allowing message content to be forwarded or copied, by blocking messages from showing up in notifications, and by automatically deleting them after they are read.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754396">Secret Chat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758601">Жашыруун Чат сүйлөшүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48695_2754398_2758603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who has been invited by their group admin to download and join Kaizala, but who hasn't.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754398">unregistered user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758603">катталбаган колдонуучу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48697_2754411_2758599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Diagnostic Data Viewer setting that allows users to view Office diagnostic data from a different machine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754411">Remote Office diagnostic data viewing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758599">Алыскы Office дарт аныктоо колдомолорду көрүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48698_2754414_2758597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of diagnostic data that is collected and sent to Microsoft about Office client software being used on computers running Windows that is used to keep Office secure and up-to-date, detect, diagnose and remediate problems, as well as to make product improvements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754414">Office diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758597">Office дарт аныктоо колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="487_146725_463453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The "one" side of two related tables in a one-to-many relationship. A primary table should have a primary key and each record should be unique.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146725">primary table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="463453">негизги жадыбал, башкы жадыбал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48703_2754422_2758598"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Diagnostic Data Viewer setting that allows users to see what Office diagnostic data is being collected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754422">Office diagnostic data viewing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758598">Office дарт аныктоо колдомолорду көрүү</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48704_2754423_2758596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A string that consists of the IP address of the user's Windows machine and the port number that the DDV app is listening on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754423">Office connection string</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758596">Office байланыш сабы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48720_2754440_2758600"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A minimum amount of diagnostic data necessary to help keep Office secure, up-to-date, and performing as expected on the device it’s installed on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754440">required diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758600">талап кылынган дарт аныктоо колдомолор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48721_2754441_2758588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office experience that provides some of its essential functionality through the use of cloud-based services. Connected experiences are Office experiences that download online content for use in Office (such as templates, images or new fonts) and/or analyze Office content (such as to provide editing suggestions or design recommendations).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754441">connected experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758588">байланышкан тажрыйба</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48722_2754443_2758585"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connected experience that is not included in Office 365 ProPlus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754443">additional optional connected experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758585">кошумча каалашынча байланышкан тажрыйба</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48723_2754445_2758595"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of data that enables the delivery of cloud-based connected experiences and that helps make those experiences secure and perform as expected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754445">necessary service data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758595">керектүү кызмат колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48724_2754447_2758589"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data that consists of content users create using Office, such as text typed in a Word document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754447">customer content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758589">кардардын мазмуну</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48725_2754449_2758594"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data needed by a connected experience to perform its task, such as configuration information about the app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754449">functional data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758594">иш-милдетке керектүү колдомолор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48726_2754450_2758602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data needed to keep the service secure, up to date, and performing as expected and is strictly related to a connected experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754450">service diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758602">кызматтын дарт аныктоо колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48727_2754452_2758593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that needs to run and send data to Microsoft in order for Office to function properly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754452">essential service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2758593">ажырагыс кызмат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48739_2755816_2762669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to technology that is designed to be used without touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2755816">hands-free</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762669">колу-бош</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48741_2756423_2762000"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of diagnostic data user can opt out of providing and that is used to make product improvements and provides enhanced information to help detect, diagnose, and remediate issues.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756423">optional diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762000">кошумча дарт аныктоо колдомолор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48742_2756424_2762005"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates installed products and their version, install and uninstall status, software add-ins and their settings, and installed products and version installation status and updates readiness.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756424">software setup and inventory data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762005">программалык жабдууну орнотуу жана эсепке алуу колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48743_2756425_2762004"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The optional diagnostic data that indicates successful app function that individual features or aspects of the application have triggered, the functioning of Office accessibility features, and privacy obligations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756425">product and service usage data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762004">өнүмдү жана кызматты керектөө колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48744_2756426_2762003"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates an unexpected application exit and the state of that application at the time, as well as poor response time or performance for different product use scenarios.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756426">product and service performance data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ky"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762003">өнүмдүн жана кызматтын иштөө ыгынын колдомолору</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KGZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48745_2756428_2761993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates the connection state and key device settings, such as memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756428">device c